@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ========================================
### Orchestration Saga: "Create Full Todo"
### ========================================

### Happy path: Create a full todo (valid user)
### This triggers: create todo -> validate user -> send notification -> generate note card
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/saga/create-full-todo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn the saga pattern",
  "userId": 1
}

### Check saga status (replace with your sagaId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/saga/status/<sagaId>

### ========================================
### Compensation path: Invalid user
### ========================================

### This triggers: create todo -> validate user (FAILS) -> delete todo (compensation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/saga/create-full-todo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This will be rolled back",
  "userId": 999
}

### Check saga status — should show FAILED after compensation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/saga/status/<sagaId>

### Verify the todo was deleted (compensation worked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
